            "review_title": "Review at Men Tươi",
            "review_text": "irada m\n1 contribution\n0\nexcellent\nMar 2025 • Friends\nhello! i arrived from Moscow to my lovely Nha Trang in March 2025. My Vietnamese Friends invited us to this restaurant twice. This is A friendly amazing place to spend time with your friends, drink beer and listen to live music. i tasted see food (lobster) with cheese for the first time in my life here. Food is delicious and you have opportunity to taste different beer there. Thank you to the owners of this restaurant and kind hospitality.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 19, 2025",
